                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Thank you @echasnovski \r\n\r\nYour hint about `commentstring` helped me find the issue. \r\n\r\nI set comment string depending on particular repositories. I had an autocommand which must have been conflicting with mini.comment. I removed this and all is well. \r\n\r\nThanks again. ",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Your hint about <code class=\"notranslate\">commentstring</code> helped me find the issue.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I set comment string depending on particular repositories. I had an autocommand which must have been conflicting with mini.comment. I removed this and all is well.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks again.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Thank you @echasnovski\nYour hint about commentstring helped me find the issue.\nI set comment string depending on particular repositories. I had an autocommand which must have been conflicting with mini.comment. I removed this and all is well.\nThanks again.",
